1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Your pattern should not need my server
to stay yours.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:11,300
Stitch & Scale starts with a local project.
No account just to begin.

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:20,200
But local is not magic. Clear your browser data,
and the notice says your local projects go with it.

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:29,300
That is the trade: no forced upload,
and a responsibility to back up what you cannot afford to lose.

5
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:38,200
I would rather show you the warning
than hide behind a promise.

6
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:45,000
Keep the work on your machine.
Then help us test what comes next.
